Hey team,
Our mobile client queries:
query GetAccountWithTransactions {
  account(id: "acc_441") {
    balance
    transactions(limit: 100) { id amount merchant { name category } }
  }
}
This query returns 504 Gateway Timeout intermittently during peak hours (18:00 - 20:00 EST).

Can you investigate why transaction resolvers are slow?
Tom Miller
Mobile Tech Lead
